 "audio": "audio.mp3",
 "duration": 55.15,
 "text": "You don't need a budget with 20 categories, you need a limit on one. Most budgets die in week two, tracking every coffee and every bus ticket turns into a second job so you stop opening the spreadsheet and the money leaks out anyway. So do this instead, open your bank app scroll through last month and add up the one category that leaks the most, for a lot of people that's food delivery. Say it came to two hundred and forty dollars, set a cap of forty a week, four weeks of forty is one sixty so that's eighty dollars you keep every month. Then every Sunday check one number, under forty, that week is a win, over don't quit, next week starts again at zero. It works for any leak, clothes, games, coffee on the way to work, just pick one not five. Tonight open your bank app, find your biggest leak and write down your weekly cap. That's what Demure is for, you archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio.",
